                <h3>Blockchain Verified</h3>
                <p>
                    All token rewards are recorded on the blockchain. 
                    Transparent and decentralized!
                </p>
            </div>
            <div class="feature-card">
                <div class="feature-icon">🏆</div>
                <h3>Everyone Wins</h3>
                <p>
                    No competition needed. Every player who completes the game 
                    earns their reward!
                </p>
